es at relevant places (granular hyperlink to a specific capability page)\\n* Details under operation code examples - what happens on the backend - what fields are updated etc\\n* Remove deprecation, backward compat notices\\n* Elaborate \\\"if\\\" guard\\n* Elaborate silent, system, context, debounce\\n* \",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFO-20/datafn-docs-improvements\",\"status\":\"Todo\",\"statusType\":\"unstarted\",\"team\":\"SF\",\"teamId\":\"da47f6a7-feab-49d0-bf5a-b54274487eb6\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-21T11:41:06.162Z\"},{\"id\":\"TIDY-339\",\"title\":\"Query builder in search, expanded search modal\",\"description\":\"Locations:\\n\\n* Global search\\n* Resource browser\\n* Library\\n* Links pane\\n* Bookmarks pane\\n* Ability to use operators in search box to build filter query\\n* When clicked on see in full screen from any search box - opens a full screen modal with query builder search on top with results\\n* With option to \\\"Save as query collection\\\" - implemented via Query collection task\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/TIDY-339/query-builder-in-search-expanded-search-modal\",\"status\":\"Todo\",\"statusType\":\"unstarted\",\"project\":\"Nucleus Q425\",\"projectId\":\"92dbc9f8-f3b2-4983-b74b-8f786ffd08be\",\"team\":\"Nucleum\",\"teamId\":\"454a22cf-025c-423f-9bcc-2b3142b47c62\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-27T03:56:27.913Z\"},{\"id\":\"TIDY-340\",\"title\":\"Highlight colors - labels, use in filters and query builder\",\"description\":\"\\nLocations\\n\\n* Web text highlight\\n* PDF highlight\\n* Kindle highlight\\n\\n* In code, already using centralized highlight color IDs (PDF and Web text highlights) to enable this feature in the future\\n* Ideate - the need for color mapping from Kindle like external color highlight sources to Memotron color highlights\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/TIDY-340/highlight-colors-labels-use-in-filters-and-query-builder\",\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"project\":\"Memotron Q425\",\"projectId\":\"4fbce959-de73-488b-a927-0473b7c775c0\",\"team\":\"Nucleum\",\"teamId\":\"454a22cf-025c-423f-9bcc-2b3142b47c62\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-14T03:30:13.894Z\"},{\"id\":\"SFO-36\",\"title\":\"Plugfn - managed persistence, datafn persistence, docs\",\"description\":\"* Managed persistence\\n* Datafn persistence and integration\\n* Example 2 - webhooks + simple sink\\n* Example 3 - Datafn persistence\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFO-36/plugfn-managed-persistence-datafn-persistence-docs\",\"status\":\"Todo\",\"statusType\":\"unstarted\",\"team\":\"SF\",\"teamId\":\"da47f6a7-feab-49d0-bf5a-b54274487eb6\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-25T13:07:06.774Z\"},{\"id\":\"TIDY-415\",\"title\":\"Datafn integration - client and sync server\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/TIDY-415/datafn-integration-client-and-sync-server\",\"status\":\"Duplicate\",\"statusType\":\"duplicate\",\"project\":\"Nucleum architecture improv\",\"projectId\":\"4dbbde00-9dc0-44ce-8490-092818b659e7\",\"team\":\"Nucleum\",\"teamId\":\"454a22cf-025c-423f-9bcc-2b3142b47c62\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:06:00.772Z\"},{\"id\":\"SFO-37\",\"title\":\"Super functions improvements - via Nucleum datafn adoption\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFO-37/super-functions-improvements-via-nucleum-datafn-adoption\",\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"project\":\"Super functions t1\",\"projectId\":\"ddb7a6a8-0c46-48f2-80c1-e4533bbe1750\",\"team\":\"SF\",\"teamId\":\"da47f6a7-feab-49d0-bf5a-b54274487eb6\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-28T12:39:53.136Z\"},{\"id\":\"SFO-22\",\"title\":\"Datafn - swift client, core data persistence, js bridge\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFO-22/datafn-swift-client-core-data-persistence-js-bridge\",\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"project\":\"Super functions t1\",\"projectId\":\"ddb7a6a8-0c46-48f2-80c1-e4533bbe1750\",\"team\":\"SF\",\"teamId\":\"da47f6a7