y primitives from Skillplane\",\"description\":\"## Executive summary\\n\\nRefactor Skillplane so released Superfunctions packages own the framework behavior and security primitives they already provide, while Skillplane retains only product-specific policy and domain logic.\\n\\nThis backlog item captures the remaining actionable findings from the 2026-08-22 repository-wide Superfunctions duplication audit. DataFn adoption is already tracked by <issue id=\\\"4056b3f8-de07-41bb-aad7-e3537d397b93\\\" href=\\\"h… (truncated, use `get_issue` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SKI-10/remove-duplicated-framework-and-security-primitives-from-skillplane\",\"status\":\"Todo\",\"statusType\":\"unstarted\",\"project\":\"Skillplane v0\",\"projectId\":\"ae4328e4-1b9e-43fb-a45b-de5d0992b7e2\",\"team\":\"Skillplane\",\"teamId\":\"f78447bd-7d2c-4a8d-be37-8656943ffbeb\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-25T11:52:16.670Z\"},{\"id\":\"SFO-42\",\"title\":\"Make apifn production ready\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFO-42/make-apifn-production-ready\",\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"project\":\"Super functions t1\",\"projectId\":\"ddb7a6a8-0c46-48f2-80c1-e4533bbe1750\",\"team\":\"SF\",\"teamId\":\"da47f6a7-feab-49d0-bf5a-b54274487eb6\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-12T11:37:31.129Z\"},{\"id\":\"SAL-16\",\"title\":\"Migrate Postgres, Redis\",\"description\":\"* Please login to [https://490153405115.signin.aws.amazon.com/console](<https://490153405115.signin.aws.amazon.com/console>) and go to AWS Lightsail -> databases ([https://ap-south-1.lightsail.aws.amazon.com/ls/webapp/home/databases](<https://ap-south-1.lightsail.aws.amazon.com/ls/webapp/home/databases>))\\n* Migrate current saloonify dev db data, schema to `saloonify-dev` db on Lightsail\\n* Migrate current saloonify live db data, schema to `saloonify-live` db on Lightsail\\n* Test on dev with new db\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SAL-16/migrate-postgres-redis